# 🛡️═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#                     AutoRAG Architect — Root .gitignore
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Version: v3.1
#
# PURPOSE
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This file defines repository-wide ignore rules for:
# - secrets
# - local runtime artifacts
# - generated files
# - build outputs
# - infrastructure state
# - temporary development files
#
# IMPORTANT TEAM RULES
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# ✅ SAFE TO COMMIT
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# - *.example templates
# - documentation
# - source code
# - infrastructure definitions
#
# ❌ NEVER COMMIT
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# - real .env files
# - production credentials
# - cloud secrets
# - Terraform state
# - local runtime data
# - generated build artifacts
#
# If secrets are accidentally committed:
# 1. Rotate secrets immediately
# 2. Remove from Git history
# 3. Notify project leads
#
# 🛡️═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ENVIRONMENT FILES & SECRETS
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# REAL runtime environment files
# NEVER commit these.
#
# ⚠️ UPDATED 17-Jul-2026: root .env.example reintroduced (placeholder values
# only, safe to commit — see the file itself). Team leads still distribute
# real, pre-filled .env files directly for actual local dev; the template
# exists as the authoritative field-name reference so a fresh template never
# silently drifts from what app/core/config.py actually reads (the real .env
# had accumulated several dead/unused variable names before this).
#
# NEVER commit:
#   ❌ .env
#   ❌ .env.dev
#   ❌ .env.staging
#   ❌ .env.prod
#
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.dev.example
!.env.staging.example
!.env.prod.example

# Additional framework-specific env files
.env.local
.env.development.local
.env.test.local
.env.production.local

# Secrets / certificates / private keys
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# PYTHON
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Python tooling caches
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pyre/
.hypothesis/

# Virtual environments
venv/
.venv/
env/

# Build artifacts
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# Coverage reports
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Notebook checkpoints
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Python version manager
.python-version


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# NODE.JS / NEXT.JS
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

node_modules/

# Next.js build output
.next/
out/

# Package manager caches
.npm
.pnpm-store/

# Package manager logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Turborepo / Turbopack
.turbo/

# Next.js generated types
next-env.d.ts


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# DOCKER & CONTAINERS
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Local Docker runtime artifacts
#
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

docker-data/
*.tar


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# LANGGRAPH / AI RUNTIME ARTIFACTS
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Local orchestration runtime state
# Never commit generated execution state
#
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

checkpoints/
runtime-state/
execution-logs/
graph-cache/


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# OBSERVABILITY & MONITORING
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# These may contain:
# - internal IPs
# - credentials
# - deployment topology
#
# Template/example configs ARE committed.
#
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

observability/prometheus/prometheus.yml
observability/grafana/grafana.ini


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# IDE / EDITORS
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

.vscode/
.idea/


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# OPERATING SYSTEM FILES
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# LOGS & TEMPORARY FILES
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

logs/
*.log

.temp/
tmp/
temp/

scratch/

# testing/ removed 26-Jul-2026 — its contents (corpus, results, fixture PDFs) were
# consolidated into evaluation/ (tracked) at the user's explicit request. See
# .claude/MEMORY.md L-017/L-018 for the tracked-vs-gitignored history.

# Local media/debug storage
mediaStorage/

# Local reference docs (not committed)
mydocs/

# Claude Code auto-memory — never committed (MEMORY.md security rule). This
# targets Claude Code's global cross-session memory, which lives entirely
# outside this repo (in the user's home directory) and was never at risk of
# being committed anyway. The bare pattern below was found (25-Jul-2026)
# to also silently catch this project's own tracked .claude/memory/
# institutional-memory folder -- e.g. .claude/memory/session_02jul_2026_merges.md
# existed on disk, was referenced by .claude/MEMORY.md, but had never
# actually been committed because of this rule. Excluded below.
memory/
!.claude/memory/


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# TERRAFORM / INFRASTRUCTURE
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Terraform state contains:
# - cloud resource IDs
# - infrastructure topology
# - secrets
#
# NEVER commit Terraform state.
#
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/

terraform.tfvars
terraform.tfvars.json

crash.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# TESTING ARTIFACTS
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

playwright-report/
test-results/
coverage/


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# MISCELLANEOUS
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

*.bak
*.swp
*.tmp
*.orig
jay_project_observations

# Personal maintenance scripts + generated reports
scripts/post_pr_update.py
scripts/LINK_REPORT.txt
scripts/audit_history/

# Version 5 planning documents (private roadmap — not committed to repo;
# renamed 20-Jul-2026, was "V4" until Version 4.0 shipped for real)
.claude/V4-PLAN.md
.claude/docs/roadmap/VERSION_5_ROADMAP.md
.claude/docs/guardrails-v4-roadmap.md
.claude/docs/observability-v4-roadmap.md

# Internal project guides (private — not committed to repo)
project-guides/
